---
layout: base.njk
nav: analysis
pagination:
  data: datasets.schedb
  size: 1
  alias: l
permalink: "{{ l.url }}"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ l.title }}"
  description: "{{ l.excerpt }}"
---
<article class="ledger-page schedb-page">
  <header class="lhead">
  <div class="crumb"><a href="/">The file</a> › <a href="/analyses/">Analyses</a></div>
  <h1>{{ l.title }}</h1>
  <p class="sub">Satellite earth stations licensed or pending at the FCC in
    {% for b in l.bands %}{{ b.label }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}, one row per site.
    Each row is read from the Form 312 Schedule B the applicant filed: site coordinates, antennas,
    frequency ranges, emissions, EIRP, points of communication, and coordination answers.
    The frequency box matches every range a site's latest filing lists, not only the band above.</p>
  <div class="meta-col">
  <p class="stamp">Currency: read from ICFS {{ l.currency_date or "—" }} · {{ l.stats.applications or 0 }} application{{ "s" if l.stats.applications != 1 }} · {{ l.count }} site{{ "s" if l.count != 1 }}.</p>
  <p class="stamp-note">{{ l.authority_note }} A site groups every filing for the same location;
    the latest live filing supplies the displayed parameters and the rest are listed beneath it.
    Expired and dismissed sites stay in the table under their status.</p>
  </div>
  </header>

  <div class="controls">
    <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Filter by applicant, call sign, file number, city, state, emission, antenna, or satellite…" aria-label="Filter earth stations">
    <div class="freq" role="group" aria-labelledby="freq-lbl">
      <span class="grp-lbl" id="freq-lbl">Filed frequency</span>
      <input id="flo" type="number" step="any" min="0" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="from" aria-label="Lower frequency">
      <span aria-hidden="true">to</span>
      <input id="fhi" type="number" step="any" min="0" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="to" aria-label="Upper frequency">
      <select id="funit" aria-label="Frequency unit"><option value="ghz" selected>GHz</option><option value="mhz">MHz</option></select>
    </div>
    {% for g in l.chips %}
    <div class="chip-group" data-group="{{ g.key }}">
      <span class="grp-lbl">{{ g.name }}</span>
      {% for c in g.chips %}
      <button class="chip" data-group="{{ g.key }}" data-list="{{ c.list }}" aria-pressed="{{ 'true' if c.on else 'false' }}">{{ c.label }}</button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% if not loop.last %}<span class="chip-sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    <span class="count" id="count"></span>
  </div>
  <p class="exports">Dataset (every site, one line per site, antenna, and frequency range, with build timestamp):
    <a href="{{ l.url }}{{ l.id }}.csv">Download CSV</a> ·
    <a href="{{ l.url }}{{ l.id }}.json">JSON (full rows)</a></p>

  <div class="scroll">
  <table id="ledger" data-noun="sites">
    <colgroup>
      <col style="width:15%"><col style="width:7%"><col style="width:8%"><col style="width:9%"><col style="width:11%">
      <col style="width:10%"><col style="width:12%"><col style="width:10%"><col style="width:6%"><col style="width:12%">
    </colgroup>
    <thead><tr>
      <th data-key="applicant" aria-sort="ascending"><span class="lab">Applicant</span></th>
      <th data-key="callsign"><span class="lab">Call sign</span></th>
      <th data-key="type"><span class="lab">Type</span></th>
      <th data-key="status"><span class="lab">Status</span></th>
      <th data-key="location"><span class="lab">Location</span></th>
      <th data-key="coords"><span class="lab">Lat, long</span></th>
      <th data-key="ranges"><span class="lab">In-band ranges</span></th>
      <th data-key="antenna"><span class="lab">Antenna</span></th>
      <th data-key="eirp" class="wrap"><span class="lab">Max EIRP (dBW)</span></th>
      <th data-key="filing"><span class="lab">Latest filing</span></th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for row in l.rows %}
      <tr class="row{% if row.flags and row.flags.length %} flagged{% endif %}" data-search="{{ row.search }}" data-lists="{{ row.lists }}" data-ranges="{{ row.filed_ranges }}">
        <td><button class="expand" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Show details">+</button> {{ row.applicant }}{% if row.frn %}<span class="basis">FRN {{ row.frn }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="mono">{{ row.callsign or "—" }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.type_label }}</td>
        <td><span class="status sb-{{ row.status_bucket }}">{{ row.status_label }}</span>{% if row.expiration_date %}<span class="basis">term ends {{ row.expiration_date }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{{ row.location or row.site.area_of_operation or "—" }}{% if row.site.county %}<span class="basis">{{ row.site.county }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="mono" data-num="{{ row.site.lat if row.coords else '' }}">{{ row.coords or "—" }}</td>
        <td class="mono" data-num="{{ row.first_lower }}">{% for r in row.ranges %}{{ r }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</td>
        <td data-num="{{ row.antennas[0].diameter_m if row.antennas.length else '' }}">{{ row.antenna_label or "—" }}{% if row.antenna_model %}<span class="basis">{{ row.antenna_model }}</span>{% endif %}{% if row.more_antennas %}<span class="basis">+ {{ row.more_antennas }} more</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="mono" data-num="{{ row.eirp }}">{{ row.eirp or "—" }}</td>
        <td class="mono">{{ row.latest_file_number }}<span class="basis">filed {{ row.latest_filed }}{% if row.filing_count > 1 %} · {{ row.filing_count }} filings{% endif %}</span><span class="basis"><a href="{{ row.icfs_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ICFS</a>{% if row.schedule_b_pdf_url %} · <a href="{{ row.schedule_b_pdf_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Schedule B</a>{% endif %}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="detail" hidden><td colspan="10">
        {% if row.flags and row.flags.length %}
        <p class="sb-flags"><strong>As filed:</strong> {% for f in row.flags %}{{ f }}{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}. Values are shown exactly as the applicant filed them.</p>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="sb-grid">
          <div><strong>Site</strong>
            <ul>
              {% if row.site.site_id %}<li>{{ row.site.site_id }}</li>{% endif %}
              <li>{{ [row.site.street, row.site.city, row.site.county, row.site.state, row.site.zip] | select | join(", ") or "No address filed" }}</li>
              {% if row.coords %}<li class="mono">{{ row.coords }}{% if row.site.datum %} ({{ row.site.datum | upper }}){% endif %}</li>{% endif %}
              {% if row.site.elevation_m != null %}<li>Ground elevation {{ row.site.elevation_m }} m</li>{% endif %}
              <li>{{ row.class_of_station or row.type_label }}</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div><strong>Coordination and safety</strong>
            <ul>
              <li>Frequency coordination required: {{ row.coordination.freq_coord_required or "—" }}</li>
              <li>Foreign coordination required: {{ row.coordination.foreign_coord_required or "—" }}</li>
              <li>FAA notification: {{ row.coordination.faa_notification or "—" }}</li>
              <li>Complies with 25.209(a): {{ row.coordination.comply_25209a or "—" }}</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div><strong>Points of communication</strong>
            <ul>{% for p in row.points_of_communication %}<li>{{ p.name }}{% if p.orbit %} · {{ p.orbit }}{% endif %}</li>{% else %}<li>None filed</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        {% for a in row.antennas %}
        <div class="sb-antenna"><strong>Antenna {{ a.antenna_id }}</strong>
          {{ [a.manufacturer, a.model] | select | join(" ") }}{% if a.diameter_m %} · {{ a.diameter_m }} m{% endif %}{% if a.quantity %} · quantity {{ a.quantity }}{% endif %}{% if a.height_agl_m %} · {{ a.height_agl_m }} m above ground{% endif %}{% if a.max_input_power_w %} · {{ a.max_input_power_w }} W input{% endif %}{% if a.max_eirp_dbw %} · {{ a.max_eirp_dbw }} dBW max EIRP{% endif %}
          <table class="sb-bands">
            <thead><tr><th>Range (MHz)</th><th>T/R</th><th>Gain (dBi)</th><th>Polarization</th><th>Emissions</th><th>Max EIRP (dBW)</th><th>Max EIRP density (dBW/4kHz)</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
            {% for b in a.bands %}
              <tr{% if b.in_band %} class="inband"{% endif %}><td class="mono">{{ b.lower_mhz }}–{{ b.upper_mhz }}</td><td>{{ b.tr }}</td><td>{{ b.gain_dbi if b.gain_dbi !== null else "—" }}</td><td>{{ b.polarization or "—" }}</td>
                <td class="mono">{{ b.emission_list or "—" }}</td>
                <td class="mono">{{ b.max_eirp if b.max_eirp !== null else "—" }}</td>
                <td class="mono">{{ b.max_density if b.max_density !== null else "—" }}</td></tr>
            {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
        {% if row.exhibits.length %}
        <div class="history"><strong>Exhibits on the latest filing</strong>
          <ul>{% for e in row.exhibits %}<li><a href="{{ e.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ e.name }}</a>{% if e.description %} · {{ e.description }}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="history"><strong>Filing history</strong>
          <ul>
          {% for f in row.filings %}
            <li><span class="mono">{{ f.file_number }}</span> · {{ f.filing_type_label or f.filing_type }} · filed <span class="date">{{ f.filed }}</span> · {{ f.last_action or f.state }}{% if f.grant_date %} {{ f.grant_date }}{% endif %}{% if f.expiration_date %} · term ends {{ f.expiration_date }}{% endif %} · <a href="{{ f.icfs_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ICFS</a>{% if f.schedule_b_pdf_url %} · <a href="{{ f.schedule_b_pdf_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Schedule B</a>{% endif %}</li>
          {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
      <tr class="noresults" hidden><td colspan="10">No sites match the current filter.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>

  <div class="methodology">
    <p>Rendered at build time from the analysis mesh, which <code>noir schedb</code> refreshes weekly from the
    FCC's International Communications Filing System. A row is an earth station site that appears in an
    SES application whose Schedule B lists a frequency range overlapping the band. Values are copied from
    the structured Schedule B, not extracted from PDFs. Every site is shown exactly as filed, including apparent typos in the
    filing; a row whose values look implausible, such as a frequency range that spans a decade or an
    individual site with no coordinates, is marked in its detail view but not corrected. The default view shows active
    individually licensed sites; use the chips to include blanket and ESIM authorizations or expired and
    dismissed sites. Exports: <a href="{{ l.url }}{{ l.id }}.csv">CSV</a> ·
    <a href="{{ l.url }}{{ l.id }}.json">JSON</a>.</p>
  </div>
</article>
<script src="/js/range-filter.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/ledger.js" defer></script>
